"title":"【活动】2016年洛杉矶宝可梦E3","url":"/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3891134/","why":"同为E3 2016增田直播安排的前篇预告"}],"sources":{"pokemon_names":"2026-09-23","tour_places":"2026-09-23","model":"deepseek-chat","relations_model":"deepseek-chat","concepts":"2026-09-26"},"built":"2026-09-25","edited":false,"by_seg":{"10":{"people":["增田"]},"25":{"people":["宫本先生"],"obs":1},"1":{"works":["Treehouse Live @ E3"],"obs":0},"20":{"works":["sun-moon"]},"35":{"works":["宝可梦 GO"]},"8":{"places":["E3 任天堂会场"]},"16":{"concepts":["sfx","sound-hardware"]}}},"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"E3现场直播中，增田分享宝可梦GO的捕捉玩法、音乐与音效，并介绍宝可梦GO Plus即将发售。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n日本时间凌晨2点播出的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Treehouse Live @ E3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好像有很多很多人观看了，\n真的很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从 E3 任天堂会场\n进行了直播！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n增田坐的椅子上拍的照片！聚起了人群！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                增田聊了聊\n捕捉宝可梦时的讲究，\n以及自己负责音乐和音效这件事\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n关于与\n宝可梦 太阳·月亮的\n关系\n\n<br>\n\n\n聊了聊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宫本先生为我们介绍的\n宝可梦 GO Plus\n\n<br>\n\n\n预计7月下旬发售！\n敬请期待！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于\n大家可以\n亲自游玩的\n时刻越来越近了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 GO\n敬请期待！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n日本の夜中の2時に放送された</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Treehouse Live @ E3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/001-e9cf5c83ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nかなり多くの方々に\n見て頂けたようで\n嬉しいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nE3 Nintendo の会場から\nLive放送されました！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/002-4bf9d383f6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nマスダの座った椅子からの写真！人だかりが！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/003-f8748c89fb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                マスダは\nポケモンを捕まえる事のこだわりと\n音楽と効果音を担当してること\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモン サン・ムーンとの\n関係について\n\n<br>\n\n\n喋りました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宮本さんから\nお話いただいた\nPokémon GO plus\n\n<br>\n\n\n7月下旬に発売予定の事！\nお楽しみに！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4216408/004-c4e7416286.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"265\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいよいよ\nみなさんに\nプレイしてもらえる\nタイミングが近づいてきました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nPokémon GO\nお楽しみに！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}